    "DeveloperNews aggregates publicly available developer content. We display headlines, short excerpts, and links — full articles open in the publisher's website inside the app.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DeveloperNews aggregates publicly available developer content. We display headlines, short excerpts, and links — full articles open in the publisher's website inside the app."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DeveloperNews는 공개된 개발자 콘텐츠를 수집합니다. 헤드라인, 짧은 발췌, 링크를 표시하며 전체 기사는 앱 내에서 퍼블리셔의 웹사이트에서 열립니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DeveloperNews does not run analytics or third-party tracking SDKs. However, if you sign in with Apple, Google, or email, we collect your email address and display name through Firebase Authentication to manage your account.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DeveloperNews does not run analytics or third-party tracking SDKs. However, if you sign in with Apple, Google, or email, we collect your email address and display name through Firebase Authentication to manage your account."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DeveloperNews는 분석이나 서드파티 추적 SDK를 사용하지 않습니다. 단, Apple, Google 또는 이메일로 로그인하는 경우 계정 관리를 위해 Firebase Authentication을 통해 이메일 주소와 표시 이름을 수집합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DeveloperNews is not responsible for the accuracy, availability, or behavior of third party content surfaced through the app, including any links opened in the in-app browser.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DeveloperNews is not responsible for the accuracy, availability, or behavior of third party content surfaced through the app, including any links opened in the in-app browser."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DeveloperNews는 인앱 브라우저에서 열리는 링크를 포함하여, 앱을 통해 제공되는 서드파티 콘텐츠의 정확성, 가용성, 동작에 대해 책임지지 않습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DeveloperNews is provided as is, without warranty of any kind. You use the app at your own discretion.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DeveloperNews is provided as is, without warranty of any kind. You use the app at your own discretion."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DeveloperNews는 어떤 종류의 보증 없이 있는 그대로 제공됩니다. 사용자의 재량에 따라 앱을 사용합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
