    "Sign-in is powered by Firebase Authentication, a service provided by Google. When you sign in, Firebase stores your email, display name, and account creation date. You can delete your account at any time from Settings, which removes your authentication data from Firebase.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign-in is powered by Firebase Authentication, a service provided by Google. When you sign in, Firebase stores your email, display name, and account creation date. You can delete your account at any time from Settings, which removes your authentication data from Firebase."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "로그인은 Google에서 제공하는 Firebase Authentication을 통해 처리됩니다. 로그인 시 Firebase에 이메일, 표시 이름, 계정 생성일이 저장됩니다. 설정에서 언제든지 계정을 삭제할 수 있으며, 삭제 시 Firebase의 인증 데이터가 제거됩니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
